  "description": "An act whose @action is an undefined string is an extension act: it may carry the members of every act (@targets, @basis, @party) and is accepted. A member allowed only on particular actions is invalid on it: @outcome or @frame fails 10.2.4 and @effective fails 10.2.7. An @action that is not a string, and an undefined review @outcome, are wrong shapes (10.2.4). A withdrawal may target an extension act, and the extension act is no support.",
